at":"2026-10-22T10:06:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032017","verified_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1846651706686676","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"update","title":"Minor Update 1 post Demo Launch","summary":"Minor Update:Minor ChangesReinstated level requirements for weapons/armourWooden Armour requires lvl 2 armour experienceBone Armour requires lvl 3 armour experienceBone Weapons requires lvl 3 in their respective weapon types The players torches have been tilted down by 30 deg to see more of the ground in front of you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:38:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1846651706684681","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Demo! And Playertest lead improvements","summary":"Red Soil Demo has arrived!As part of the Steam next fest, Red Soil will be available for everyone to play as it's ramping up towards Early Access release.The game has undergone several rounds of Playtesting in the last two months and has been significantly improved from the feedback and suggestions.The DemoThe demo will contain the Tutorial level as well as a small sandbox map. The player will be capped to level 4, but otherwise all features of the current build are included.I look forward to ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:09:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1839041357029159","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"update","title":"Major Update 0.624. 20 New Zombies, 5 hostile archetypes, Australian Flora","summary":"Welcome to 0.624!This update marks a large milestone in the Beta development of the game. Hostile Update and Balance 0.220 Zombie models and 5 Archetypes have been added. There are unique animation and audio sets to each type of hostile.Let's meet the familyWalker:The walker is the most common threat walking about on red soil. They move slowly and don't excel in any particular threat. There are 15 new Walkers with 5 animation setsScreamer:If this hungry fella is interrupted from his meal he will","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T10:41:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357029159","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1835871199304095","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"update","title":"Major Update 0.623 : UI update, highlighted interactables!","summary":"Greetings survivors!I've spent the last 6 weeks focusing on game polish, specifically the UI and the way that walls/roofs/building elements are hidden when a player is in a building. Major Features:Complete Overhaul of UIEvery UI element has been replaced!Updated starting screenUpdated all fontUpdated tooltip displayand much, much moreAdded object highlightsInteractable objects will now have a yellow outline when you hover your cursor over themPlants/rocks that can be harvested will have a green","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T12:39:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199304095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1829528821311660","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.622 - New player animations, hostile movement animation fixes","summary":"Greetings survivors!It's been a busy 4 months. The majority of the work done will not be obvious to the player as it optimised the workflow and world building mechanics. Major Features:Overhauled animator treeRemoves dying animation bug/weirdnessAllows greater control to crafting and resting animationsAdded unique animation sets for:1 handed weapon + off-hand equipment1 handed weapon with no off-hand2 handed spearUnarmed2 handed weaponAnimations set include an Idle, walking, running, 3 different","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-11T03:48:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821311660","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1821288646583488","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.621","summary":"Update 0.621This Update brings updated class models and several new UI and game features. Class modelsThe Paramedic and Park Ranger class now have their own unique modelsExperience bar/IndicatorExperience is now show above the action bar. This includes level display and an indication of EXP to level.Jump Scare/AlertIf a hostile becomes visible for the first time to a player within 3m, an alert sound is made. This alert has a 60 second global cooldown.New Point of Interest - Commercial: MediumAdd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-10T22:06:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646583488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1818118366175185","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.62 - Temperature","summary":"Update 0.62This Update brings in a more advance Environmental vs Player Body Temperature mechanic.Body Temperature RangesThe players body temperature can fluctuate between Hypothermia and Hyperthermia, with increasing debuffs as they get to the extremes. Pay attention during midday where the extreme heat can cause Hyperthermia in a matter of minutes (in-game hours).Using Stamina on actions like sprinting and attacking will raise your body temperature. Keep this in mind if you find yourself stuck","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-05T06:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366175185","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4164780-1817483467044805","game_id":"steam-4164780","kind":"announcement","title":"Red Soil Beta now Open!","summary":"After years of solo development, Red Soil is now ready for Beta Testing!I look forward to receiving feedback to improve gameplay and balance the many features the game has to offer.Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-01T10:20:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467044805","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4164780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4164780":"2026-10-26T11:43:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4164780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:56Z"},"5198030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-2